{"seq":1,"slug":"rtos-scheduling-principles","title":"RTOS 调度原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/rtos-scheduling-principles","wordCount":1716,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"rtos-调度原理\">RTOS 调度原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RTOS 用调度器把单一 CPU 时间切分给多个任务，从而在裸机超级循环无法胜任的多任务场景中提供确定性时序。其核心可归纳为四条主线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>调度策略</strong>：基于优先级的抢占式调度与同优先级时间片轮转，决定任何时刻谁获得 CPU</li>\n<li><strong>上下文切换</strong>：借助 PendSV 异常在最低优先级完成寄存器保存与恢复，是任务切换的硬件基础</li>\n<li><strong>时间基准</strong>：SysTick 提供系统 Tick，驱动延时、超时与时间片计数</li>\n<li><strong>实时性保证</strong>：任务状态机与 Rate Monotonic 可行性分析界定系统能否满足截止期限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-rtos\">为什么需要 RTOS</h2><p>裸机编程中，应用逻辑通常以超级循环（Super Loop）模式运行：主函数中无限循环依次执行各任务，中断处理紧急事件。当系统复杂度增加时，超级循环面临根本性挑战：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 超级循环模型&#10;        MAIN[main 循环] --&gt; T1[任务 1: 传感器采集]&#10;        T1 --&gt; T2[任务 2: 数据处理]&#10;        T2 --&gt; T3[任务 3: 通信发送]&#10;        T3 --&gt; T4[任务 4: 显示更新]&#10;        T4 --&gt; MAIN&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph RTOS 多任务模型&#10;        SCHED[调度器] --&gt; RT1[高优先级: 电机控制]&#10;        SCHED --&gt; RT2[中优先级: 通信协议]&#10;        SCHED --&gt; RT3[低优先级: 显示/日志]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 超级循环模型\n        MAIN[main 循环] --&gt; T1[任务 1: 传感器采集]\n        T1 --&gt; T2[任务 2: 数据处理]\n        T2 --&gt; T3[任务 3: 通信发送]\n        T3 --&gt; T4[任务 4: 显示更新]\n        T4 --&gt; MAIN\n    end\n    subgraph RTOS 多任务模型\n        SCHED[调度器] --&gt; RT1[高优先级: 电机控制]\n        SCHED --&gt; RT2[中优先级: 通信协议]\n        SCHED --&gt; RT3[低优先级: 显示/日志]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>超级循环</th>\n<th>RTOS 多任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>响应延迟</td>\n<td>最差=循环总时长</td>\n<td>确定性（最高优先级立即执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码结构</td>\n<td>所有任务紧耦合</td>\n<td>各任务独立，关注点分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序确定性</td>\n<td>随任务增加而恶化</td>\n<td>由优先级和调度策略保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻塞等待</td>\n<td>必须轮询或超时返回</td>\n<td>原生支持挂起/唤醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源开销</td>\n<td>极低（无调度器）</td>\n<td>额外 RAM（每任务一个栈）+ ROM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单控制、极低资源</td>\n<td>多任务、实时性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调度算法\">调度算法</h2><h3 id=\"抢占式优先级调度\">抢占式优先级调度</h3><p>RTOS 中最常用的调度策略是基于优先级的抢占式调度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>运行任务</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>就绪任务</mtext></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>优先级</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{运行任务} = \\arg\\max_{\\text{就绪任务}} (\\text{优先级})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运行任务</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4943em;vertical-align:-0.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">就绪任务</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优先级</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>核心规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最高优先级的就绪任务始终获得 CPU</li>\n<li>更高优先级任务就绪时，低优先级任务被立即抢占</li>\n<li>相同优先级的任务按时间片轮转执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"时间片轮转\">时间片轮转</h3><p>对于同优先级任务，调度器分配固定长度的时间片（Time Slice）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>时间片</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>Tick</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（N 为配置的 Tick 数）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{时间片} = N \\times T_{\\text{Tick}} \\quad \\text{（N 为配置的 Tick 数）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时间片</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Tick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">N </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为配置的</span><span class=\"mord\"> Tick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当任务消耗完时间片后，调度器切换到同优先级的下一个就绪任务。时间片的选择需要权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>太短：上下文切换开销占比过高</li>\n<li>太长：同优先级任务响应延迟增大</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"协作式调度\">协作式调度</h3><p>协作式调度中，任务仅在主动让出 CPU 时（调用 yield 或进入阻塞状态）才发生切换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>切换条件</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>taskYIELD()</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>进入阻塞 API</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{切换条件} = \\text{taskYIELD()} \\lor \\text{进入阻塞 API}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">切换条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">taskYIELD()</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进入阻塞</span><span class=\"mord\"> API</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优点是无需考虑抢占带来的数据竞争，缺点是一个任务长时间占用 CPU 会饿死其他任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文切换机制\">上下文切换机制</h2><h3 id=\"任务上下文\">任务上下文</h3><p>每个任务拥有独立的执行上下文，包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保存内容</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>大小（Cortex-M4F）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>R0-R3, R12, LR, PC, xPSR</td>\n<td>硬件自动压栈</td>\n<td>32 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R4-R11</td>\n<td>软件手动保存</td>\n<td>32 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S0-S15, FPSCR</td>\n<td>硬件自动（若使用 FPU）</td>\n<td>68 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S16-S31</td>\n<td>软件手动（懒入栈）</td>\n<td>64 字节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"pendsv-实现上下文切换\">PendSV 实现上下文切换</h3><p>Cortex-M 使用 PendSV（可挂起系统调用）异常实现上下文切换：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant APP as 应用代码&#10;    participant SYSTICK as SysTick ISR&#10;    participant PENDSV as PendSV ISR&#10;    participant SCHED as 调度器&#10;&#10;    SYSTICK-&gt;&gt;SYSTICK: Tick 计数+1&#10;    SYSTICK-&gt;&gt;SCHED: 检查是否需要切换&#10;    SCHED-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 挂起 PendSV(设置 ICSR.PENDSVSET)&#10;    Note over SYSTICK: SysTick 退出&#10;    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 保存当前任务 R4-R11 到 PSP&#10;    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;SCHED: 获取下一任务 TCB&#10;    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 从新任务 TCB 恢复 R4-R11&#10;    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 更新 PSP&#10;    Note over PENDSV: 异常返回时硬件自动恢复 R0-R3 等\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant APP as 应用代码\n    participant SYSTICK as SysTick ISR\n    participant PENDSV as PendSV ISR\n    participant SCHED as 调度器\n\n    SYSTICK-&gt;&gt;SYSTICK: Tick 计数+1\n    SYSTICK-&gt;&gt;SCHED: 检查是否需要切换\n    SCHED-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 挂起 PendSV(设置 ICSR.PENDSVSET)\n    Note over SYSTICK: SysTick 退出\n    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 保存当前任务 R4-R11 到 PSP\n    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;SCHED: 获取下一任务 TCB\n    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 从新任务 TCB 恢复 R4-R11\n    PENDSV-&gt;&gt;PENDSV: 更新 PSP\n    Note over PENDSV: 异常返回时硬件自动恢复 R0-R3 等</pre><p>PendSV 被配置为最低优先级异常，确保所有 ISR 完成后才执行上下文切换，避免在高优先级中断处理期间发生切换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"切换耗时分析\">切换耗时分析</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>context_switch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>PendSV_entry</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>save_regs</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>scheduler</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>restore_regs</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>PendSV_exit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{context\\_switch}} = T_{\\text{PendSV\\_entry}} + T_{\\text{save\\_regs}} + T_{\\text{scheduler}} + T_{\\text{restore\\_regs}} + T_{\\text{PendSV\\_exit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">context_switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PendSV_entry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">save_regs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scheduler</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">restore_regs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PendSV_exit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型 Cortex-M4 @ 168 MHz 的上下文切换时间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>周期数</th>\n<th>时间（@ 168 MHz）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异常入口（硬件压栈）</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>71 ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保存 R4-R11</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>48 ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度器查找</td>\n<td>~20</td>\n<td>119 ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复 R4-R11</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>48 ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常返回（硬件出栈）</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>71 ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~60</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~357 ns</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"systick-定时器\">SysTick 定时器</h2><h3 id=\"角色与配置\">角色与配置</h3><p>SysTick 是 Cortex-M 内核自带的 24 位递减计数器，作为 RTOS 的心跳时钟（Tick）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>Tick</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>HCLK</mtext></msub><mrow><mtext>LOAD</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{Tick}} = \\frac{f_{\\text{HCLK}}}{\\text{LOAD} + 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Tick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LOAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HCLK</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型配置为 1 ms（1 kHz Tick 频率）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LOAD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>168</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>167999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LOAD} = \\frac{168,000,000}{1000} - 1 = 167999</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LOAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">168</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">167999</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"tick-的作用\">Tick 的作用</h3><p>每次 SysTick 中断执行以下操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>全局 Tick 计数器递增（用于 vTaskDelay 等时间 API）</li>\n<li>检查阻塞任务的超时条件</li>\n<li>更新时间片计数器</li>\n<li>若需要切换，挂起 PendSV</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"tickless-空闲模式\">Tickless 空闲模式</h3><p>当系统无就绪任务时，Tickless 模式停止 SysTick 以降低功耗：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>跳过 Tick 数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>最近唤醒时间</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>SysTick 最大计数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{跳过 Tick 数} = \\min(\\text{最近唤醒时间}, \\text{SysTick 最大计数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跳过</span><span class=\"mord\"> Tick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最近唤醒时间</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SysTick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大计数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>唤醒后补偿跳过的 Tick 数，确保系统时间的正确性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"任务状态机\">任务状态机</h2><h3 id=\"四状态模型\">四状态模型</h3><p>RTOS 中每个任务处于以下四种状态之一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Ready: 创建&#10;    Ready --&gt; Running: 被调度器选中&#10;    Running --&gt; Ready: 被抢占/时间片耗尽&#10;    Running --&gt; Blocked: 等待事件/延时&#10;    Running --&gt; Suspended: 挂起 API 调用&#10;    Blocked --&gt; Ready: 事件到达/超时&#10;    Suspended --&gt; Ready: 恢复 API 调用\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Ready: 创建\n    Ready --&gt; Running: 被调度器选中\n    Running --&gt; Ready: 被抢占/时间片耗尽\n    Running --&gt; Blocked: 等待事件/延时\n    Running --&gt; Suspended: 挂起 API 调用\n    Blocked --&gt; Ready: 事件到达/超时\n    Suspended --&gt; Ready: 恢复 API 调用</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>参与调度</th>\n<th>消耗 CPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Running</td>\n<td>正在执行</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ready</td>\n<td>等待被调度</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blocked</td>\n<td>等待事件或超时</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suspended</td>\n<td>手动挂起</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"就绪列表\">就绪列表</h3><p>调度器通过就绪列表（按优先级索引的链表数组）在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间内找到最高优先级的就绪任务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>就绪列表</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>pxReadyTasksLists</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>configMAX_PRIORITIES</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{就绪列表} = \\text{pxReadyTasksLists}[\\text{configMAX\\_PRIORITIES}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">就绪列表</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pxReadyTasksLists</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">configMAX_PRIORITIES</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每次调度只需读取最高非空优先级索引即可，使用位图（bitmap）加速查找。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实时性保证\">实时性保证</h2><h3 id=\"硬实时与软实时\">硬实时与软实时</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>截止期限违反后果</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬实时</td>\n<td>系统失效/安全事故</td>\n<td>安全气囊、ABS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固实时</td>\n<td>结果无效但不危险</td>\n<td>视频解码帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软实时</td>\n<td>性能下降但可接受</td>\n<td>网络数据包处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"调度可行性分析\">调度可行性分析</h3><p>对于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个周期性任务，Rate Monotonic 调度的可行性充分条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{C_i}{T_i} \\leq n(2^{1/n} - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为任务最坏执行时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为任务周期。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\rightarrow \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时极限值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.693</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln 2 \\approx 0.693</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.693</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"中断延迟边界\">中断延迟边界</h3><p>RTOS 引入的最坏中断延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>IRQ_latency</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>longest_critical_section</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>HW_entry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{IRQ\\_latency}} = T_{\\text{longest\\_critical\\_section}} + T_{\\text{HW\\_entry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IRQ_latency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">longest_critical_section</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HW_entry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>FreeRTOS 通过 configMAX_SYSCALL_INTERRUPT_PRIORITY 将高于该优先级的中断完全不受 RTOS 临界区影响，确保关键中断的零抖动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>调度策略</strong>：抢占式优先级调度保证最高优先级就绪任务始终运行，同优先级按时间片轮转；协作式调度切换可控但可能饿死任务。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文切换</strong>：Cortex-M 用最低优先级的 PendSV 完成切换，避免打断 ISR；典型 M4 @168 MHz 单次切换约 60 周期（~357 ns）。</li>\n<li><strong>时间基准</strong>：SysTick 以配置的 Tick 频率驱动延时与超时；无就绪任务时 Tickless 模式停摆降功耗并在唤醒后补偿。</li>\n<li><strong>任务状态</strong>：Running/Ready/Blocked/Suspended 四状态模型，就绪列表按优先级索引，用位图在 O(1) 内找到最高优先级任务。</li>\n<li><strong>可行性判据</strong>：Rate Monotonic 的充分条件为总利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U \\leq n(2^{1/n}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其极限约为 ln 2 ≈ 0.693。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTOS 调度原理","id":"rtos-调度原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 RTOS","id":"为什么需要-rtos"},{"level":2,"text":"调度算法","id":"调度算法"},{"level":3,"text":"抢占式优先级调度","id":"抢占式优先级调度"},{"level":3,"text":"时间片轮转","id":"时间片轮转"},{"level":3,"text":"协作式调度","id":"协作式调度"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文切换机制","id":"上下文切换机制"},{"level":3,"text":"任务上下文","id":"任务上下文"},{"level":3,"text":"PendSV 实现上下文切换","id":"pendsv-实现上下文切换"},{"level":3,"text":"切换耗时分析","id":"切换耗时分析"},{"level":2,"text":"SysTick 定时器","id":"systick-定时器"},{"level":3,"text":"角色与配置","id":"角色与配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Tick 的作用","id":"tick-的作用"},{"level":3,"text":"Tickless 空闲模式","id":"tickless-空闲模式"},{"level":2,"text":"任务状态机","id":"任务状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"四状态模型","id":"四状态模型"},{"level":3,"text":"就绪列表","id":"就绪列表"},{"level":2,"text":"实时性保证","id":"实时性保证"},{"level":3,"text":"硬实时与软实时","id":"硬实时与软实时"},{"level":3,"text":"调度可行性分析","id":"调度可行性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"中断延迟边界","id":"中断延迟边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通信接口驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/communication-interface-drivers"},"next":{"title":"任务管理与同步机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/task-management-synchronization"}}